---
description: Cross-agent continuity for Dockie
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `.ai/WORKFLOW.md`, `.ai/PROJECT_STATE.md`, `.ai/HANDOFF.md`, and `.ai/ACTIVE_WORK.md`.
Never change `applicationId` (`com.dockie.app`) or replace the existing production signing key.
Never commit secrets (keystore, play-service-account.json, passwords).
Use Graphify before broad codebase exploration when `graphify-out/graph.json` exists.
